260
00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:02.200
Graduates of the Farm
rarely go on the record

261
00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:04.200
about their experience...

262
00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:05.880
until 2019.

263
00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:08.600
- Former CIA intelligence
officer Amaryllis Fox

264
00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:10.880
actually wrote
about all of her experiences

265
00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:13.160
at the Farm in her book.
"Life Undercover."

266
00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:14.920
♪ ♪

267
00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:17.160
The Farm is truly a journey

268
00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:20.000
that's inspiring
and pleasurable.

269
00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:23.040
more than it is something
that's scary and terrifying.

270
00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:24.800
The scary and terrifying part

271
00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:27.360
