278
00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:50.720
[dramatic music]

279
00:11:50.840 --> 00:11:55.040
- By 1938. British government
know that war with Germany

280
00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:56.480
is on the horizon.

281
00:11:56.600 --> 00:11:58.160
And this war is going to be

282
00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:00.200
