his cabinet underground.

305
00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:04.280
♪ ♪

306
00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:06.360
- On September 7. 1940.

307
00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:09.800
the Luftwaffe drop
