311
00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:20.240
♪ ♪

312
00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:22.960
Black Saturday
is only the beginning.

313
00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:26.360
57 consecutive days
of attacks followed.

314
00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:28.960
testing the resilience
of both London

315
00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:31.640
and its leadership
as never before.

316
00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:33.080
♪ ♪

317
00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:34.760
[Duchovny]
Despite the hammerings.

318
00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:37.320
the war rooms
and Churchill survive.

319
00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:41.040
So the Germans
turn up the heat.

320
00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:44.600
- By late 1940. the Germans
are using parachute mines.

321
00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:47.400
And these weapons descend
under an open parachute.

322
00:13:47.520 --> 00:13:48.800
and they're fused such

323
00:13:48.920 --> 00:13:50.880
that they will explode
at rooftop level.

324
00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:53.160
and they'll create a pattern
of destruction

325
00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:55.160
that's 300 feet in diameter.

326
00:13:55.280 --> 00:13:57.240
They can flatten
an entire city block.

327
00:13:57.360 --> 00:13:59.920
If a weapon like this
were to explode

328
00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:01.840
over the cabinet war rooms.

329
00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:03.960
it could bury
the prime minister

330
00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:06.160
and the entire war cabinet
in one shot.

331
00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:09.200
That's a risk
that simply cannot be taken.

332
00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:11.760
[Duchovny] The underground
compound is reinforced

333
00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:13.760
with a massive concrete roof.

334
00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:16.800
referred to as "The Slab."

335
00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:19.160
- That means
that the cabinet war rooms

336
00:14:19.280 --> 00:14:22.200
can sustain a direct hit
from a 500-pound bomb.

337
00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:23.760
[Sami]
During the renovation.

338
00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:25.560
Churchill requests
the expansion

339
00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:26.960
of the complex itself.

340
00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:28.760
It triples in size.

341
00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:31.560
making room for 500 personnel

342
00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:34.440
working underground 24-7.

343
00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:36.760
[Duchovny] Such a bustling
underground workspace brings

344
00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:39.320
one particular problem...
[telephone rings]

345
00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:42.560
That Churchill hates
above all others.

346
00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:45.640
- Churchill
is notoriously sensitive

347
00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:47.240
to excess noise.

348
00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:49.760
So 500 people working
in a busy. claustrophobic.

349
00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:51.600
and echoey
underground environment

350
00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:53.160
can cause quite a ruckus.

351
00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:54.560
- To make the boss happy.

352
00:14:54.680 --> 00:14:56.320
several things
are put in place.

353
00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:59.960
One of them is phones
that don't ring

354
00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:03.120
but instead light up
whenever someone is calling.

355
00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:05.440
They also import
noiseless typewriters

356
00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:06.920
from the United States

357
00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:10.000
to mitigate all the noise
that will be created

358
00:15:10.120 --> 00:15:12.920
inside
this underground bunker.

359
00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:15.160
- The expansion
of the cabinet war rooms

360
00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:16.760
brings a new problem.

361
00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:18.960
With so many people
coming in and out.

362
00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:20.760
Churchill fears
classified talks

363
00:15:20.880 --> 00:15:23.080
with the U.S. president
