364
00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:25.520
by spies working
for the other side.

365
00:15:25.640 --> 00:15:28.800
[Sami] He needs a secure line
of communication

366
00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:31.040
with Franklin D. Roosevelt.
so he figures.

367
00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:34.560
where's the one place
I'm not gonna be interrupted

368
00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:36.640
or eavesdropped on?

369
00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:38.400
The bathroom.

370
00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:40.960
Churchill has
a new private toilet installed

371
00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:42.360
for his personal use.

372
00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:44.560
and inside is actually a phone

373
00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:46.960
that connects
to an encrypted line

374
00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:48.960
direct to the Pentagon
in Washington.

375
00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:50.720
So any spy will just assume

376
00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:52.600
that the prime minister
is taking a bathroom break.

377
00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:54.320
when. in reality.

378
00:15:54.440 --> 00:15:56.640
he's actually
masterminding victory.

379
00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:58.560
It kind of goes
back to the old adage of.

380
00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:00.720
your best ideas happen
when you're on the toilet.

381
00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:03.120
Perfect example.

382
00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:05.480
[Duchovny] The cabinet war
rooms remain the beating heart

383
00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:08.960
of Britain's war effort
