384
00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:12.200
Then two days
after Japan's surrender.

385
00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:15.840
on August 16. 1945.

386
00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:20.720
the war rooms and its secrets
are locked for good.

387
00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:23.160
For 40 years.
it lays beneath London.

388
00:16:23.280 --> 00:16:26.160
untouched and forgotten.

389
00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:28.040
Then in 1984...

390
00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:31.160
♪ ♪

391
00:16:31.280 --> 00:16:33.200
The bunker's secrets
are finally revealed

392
00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:37.560
