451
00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:12.360
[Hakeem]
Each Gravel Gertie

452
00:19:12.480 --> 00:19:15.440
is a steel-reinforced
concrete lab.

453
00:19:15.560 --> 00:19:17.240
where the technicians work.

454
00:19:17.360 --> 00:19:20.360
and above them is what amounts
