455
00:19:20.480 --> 00:19:22.520
held in place by steel cables.

456
00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:26.000
Inside the lab. three workers
assemble the nuke.

457
00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:28.160
And this process
is so sensitive

458
00:19:28.280 --> 00:19:29.960
that one of the worker's jobs

459
00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:33.800
