463
00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:45.600
Hence.
the merciless fail-safe.

464
00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:48.640
- If there's
an accidental detonation.

465
00:19:48.760 --> 00:19:50.680
the explosion will snap

466
00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:52.960
the steel cables
supporting the roof.

467
00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:55.160
The entire chamber
is then buried

468
00:19:55.280 --> 00:19:58.240
under thousands
