469
00:19:58.360 --> 00:20:01.040
The design traps
the radioactive material.

470
00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:03.320
reducing fallout by 90%.

471
00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:06.160
However. it also entombs
the three workers

472
00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:07.720
who triggered the explosion.

473
00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:10.360
It's a literal death trap.

474
00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:12.480
[Duchovny] The possibility
that each shift

475
00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:14.080
