476
00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:17.480
hangs over the heads
of the Pantex workforce.

477
00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:19.920
And yet
production rates rocket.

478
00:20:20.040 --> 00:20:24.040
- Pantex is producing 2.000
